<title>UK: RUGBY LEAGUE-FRANCE BEAT SCOTLAND 22-20.</title>
<headline>RUGBY LEAGUE-FRANCE BEAT SCOTLAND 22-20.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>France beat Scotland 22-20</p>
<p>(halftime 12-10) in an international Rugby League match on</p>
<p>Wednesday:</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Scotland - Tries: Christie, Crowther, McCarthy, Russell.</p>
<p>Goals: Crowther 2</p>
<p>France - Tries: Banquet, Devecchi, Dulac, Guisset. Goals:</p>
<p>E.Vergniol 3.</p>
<p>Attendance: 2,233</p>
</text>
